  "detail": null,
  "summary": "I ran CRC outreach for 'Okafor CRC 2026' (12 members) under RBC-QM-02. I ordered 5 new FIT kits (LAB-FIT-KIT, routine, due 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31), each with a patient message about that order. Six patients have an open gap: the 5 new orders plus pt-0024, who already had an active FIT kit order.\n\n| Patient | Age at 12/31/26 | Status | Reason / action |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older, active frailty diagnosis (since 2025-09-16) and on donepezil, a dementia medication (ordered 2025-06-10, still active). Policy §4 frailty plus advanced-illness exclusion. No action. |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Older than 75 at the end of the measurement period. No action. |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy 2018-05-21, within the 2017–2026 lookback. |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap | Last colonoscopy was 2016-11-15, outside the 2017–2026 lookback. Nothing else qualifies. FIT kit ordered (sr-t0001) and message sent (comm-t0006). |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap | Stool DNA-FIT test 2023-11-20, outside the 2024–2026 lookback. FIT kit ordered (sr-t0002) and message sent (comm-t0007). |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap | No qualifying screening on record. He has frailty (since 2026-03-04) but no advanced illness or dementia medication, so the exclusion doesn't apply. FIT kit ordered (sr-t0003) and message sent (comm-t0008). |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | In hospice since 2026-08-20 (pancreatic cancer). No action. |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total colectomy (proctocolectomy) 2015-06-03, per a scanned outside operative note. No action. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap | FIT 2025-12-03 doesn't count, because a FIT only counts in the 2026 measurement year. FIT kit ordered (sr-t0004) and message sent (comm-t0009). |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap | Turns 46 on 2026-12-15, so she is in the population. No screening on record. FIT kit ordered (sr-t0005) and message sent (comm-t0010). |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap | Last stool blood test 2024-06-11, outside 2026. She already has an active FIT kit order (sr-t3-e11-fit, 2026-09-30), so per policy I didn't place a new one. She had no outreach message on file, so I sent a reminder about that existing kit (comm-t0011); the policy doesn't require this. |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography 2022-03-08, within the 2022–2026 lookback. |\n\n**Totals:** 2 up to date, 6 open gaps (5 new FIT orders plus 1 existing order), 3 excluded, 1 not in the population.\n\n**Limits of the search:** I found no colorectal cancer diagnoses, palliative care records or nursing-home residence for any member. These searches used standard codes and note keywords, so a screening or exclusion recorded only under some other code or wording could have been missed.",
